Package: sharepointr
Title: Upload, Download, and List Files on SharePoint
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Esben",
           family = "Eickhardt",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "esbeneickhardt@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a simple interface for uploading, downloading, listing,
    and deleting files on SharePoint document libraries. Authenticates as an
    Entra ID (Azure AD) app registration using the OAuth2 client credentials
    flow (client secret or certificate), talking to either the Microsoft
    Graph API or the SharePoint REST API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/esbeneickhardt/sharepointr
